  "shadow": {
    "$description": "CSS-style layers (y, blur, spread in dp; colour + alpha). Compose: Modifier.dropShadow (Compose UI 1.9+) per layer; fallback Modifier.shadow(elevation, shape, ambientColor, spotColor) with the tint (colours honoured on API 28+). See 02 §5.3.",
